@mod HOST

# The playground's window onto the embedding host. In the browser the compiler
# runs as WebAssembly with no libc, so `@extern "C"` symbols (stdout, puts, ...)
# do not exist. `@extern "WASM"` instead names a function the host supplies as a
# wasm import; the embedder decides what it does (see web/site/host.mjs). Here
# `print` writes a line to the notebook's output pane.

$ print : Str -> {} = @extern "WASM" "print" ""
